But the law says it's like, you know, it's like now that's like a known thing in movies.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:45.740
But back then, it was kind of like novel of like, oh yeah, he's Dirty Harry because he plays dirty.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:51.440
Yeah. There were a lot more of like the hero, like the Captain America type.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:54.540
Like, I'm gonna do the right thing no matter what it is.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:55.700
You know what I'm about? Yes.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.660
Yeah. Follow the rules and, you know.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:03.200
And to be fair to these movies, I mean, Sean, you could say about the first one, but like,

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:11.420
I think that this is a very fun franchise to like kind of- like, obviously, it kind of gets worse as time goes on,

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:12.640
just like any good franchise.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:18.840
But like, it's a fun watch and I think it's a- Dirty Harry is a fun character.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:28.360
Not necessarily like, oh, make sure he gets an 8-bit NES game, but like, as a film series, like, definitely holds up.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:32.620
Well, because the Dirty Harry movies were directed at like kids in the 80s, right?

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:34.900
Like, that was their main audience.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.100
Yeah, yeah, for sure.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:40.980
They were like, definitely wanted to see how many seven-year-olds would grow up to become policemen.

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:47.260
