00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.500
The 60th anniversary of Dirty Harry.

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:38.580
It should have, like, when you press the I'm feeling lucky button, it has, like, a punk option.

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.500
