Thank you. All right.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.320
On to the game.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:55.020
It's a side-scrolling action game where you play as Dirty Harry cleaning up San Francisco.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.060
You have to navigate a city.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.320
And I mean that for real.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:02.040
It's not, like, stage one, you're in the street.

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.520
Stage two, you're in an alley.

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:04.760
Stage three, you're in a building.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:08.140
You really have to navigate this little city that they have here.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:14.540
And the basic plot of the game, as I understand it, anybody feel free to.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.020
I'm going to chime in and let me know if this isn't true.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:26.960
A Colombian kingpin called the Anaconda has basically created a few, like, he's gathered a few of the San Francisco drug gangs together.

00:09:28.340 --> 00:09:35.140
And now Harry has to, like, go and take each one of them down individually first.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:41.180
And then it all leads up to this guy who calls himself the Anaconda as his, like, final showdown.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.840
Yeah. It's like, basically, he made a super gang.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:45.360
Yeah. You can't make super gangs.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:52.700
To commit super crimes. Which really, it really worked out because, like, this is, like, the worst city in America.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.000
Right. The super gangs won.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.440
The police have given up, right?

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:56.740
It's just Harry now.

00:09:57.580 --> 00:09:59.120
Yeah. There's no, like, assist.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.420
