00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:04.420
You should be able to call on the other departments to help you out.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:09.680
But instead, this is the kind of game where it's like, who starts a game like this?

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:11.640
The level immediately starts.

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:13.800
Three guys are beating you up.

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:15.180
There's more on the way.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:18.060
You have to press A and B at the same time to jump.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:19.760
You fall into a manhole.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:20.880
It's pitch black.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.380
Things are attacking you.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:23.780
Things are shocking you.

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:25.900
And there's an invisible wall in the sewer.

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:27.460
So you can't even progress further.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.700
You have to leave the manhole.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:34.860
So having not seen any Dirty Harry movie, I just assumed, based on this, that Dirty Harry

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.340
was like a Mr. Bean-like.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.580
We're always getting into crazy situations.

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:40.340
He gets caught in a net.

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:43.420
He falls into a manhole.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.480
It's all dark. He's stumbling around.

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:47.900
That's just what happens in all these games.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:53.320
Like, they're always just like, oh, was there a scene where he went into the sewer and had

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.560
to fight RC cars?

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.560
I mean, I guess there were RC cars.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.180
I think was from one of the movies.

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:02.060
They are from one of the movies, but they are not in the sewer, and they aren't something

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:04.640
that will, like, take three points of health away from you.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:07.360
There's snakes everywhere.

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:08.680
Like, there's just...

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.880
I don't... Like, was that in the movies, Mike?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.360
Was that in Magnum Force?

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:15.500
Yeah, Indiana Jones and the Raiders of the Lost Ark.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.520
Also, like, laser floors.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:19.720
Yeah, is this 007?

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.100
So, Joe, if you didn't...

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:22.280
Joe, if you didn't...

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.240
Yeah, I was going to make that shot.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:27.560
If you didn't watch Dirty Harry, you might think he's also like a 007 kind of character.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.960
Like a spy, but he doesn't do that stuff.

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:36.940
I mean, just from, like... Just from, like, knowing of Dirty Harry through, like, the culture of growing up, you know,

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:40.980
in the time that I grew up in, I'm like, I don't think this is what happened in the movies.

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:45.700
But, you know, I couldn't know for sure until I get it confirmed from people who have seen it.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:53.800
I want to say the only thing that makes this character Dirty Harry, because the sprite is pretty nondescript.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:55.000
He could be...

00:11:55.000 --> 00:12:03.920
I thought, like, it's basically just, like, a more structurally human-like, like, double dragon character in a way.

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:08.040
I don't know. I don't know why I went there with it.

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:11.080
But then there's also, like, you could get a...

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:14.120
You can get, like, a white suit, which I don't...

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.900
Again, I don't think Dirty Harry has.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:22.260
I think the only thing that actually makes it him is the gun and the line at the beginning.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.900
Yeah. Well, and...

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.220
But what a gun it is, though.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:27.380
I mean, this is cool. It is quite the gun.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:36.160
Yeah, I think this is one of the, like, cooler-looking, like, animations for shooting a gun in an NES game we've had, where, like, it looks very adult.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:37.600
It's just, like...

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:38.700
It's just, like, a real gun.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:44.420
Like, you are killing someone one hit, no matter what, and he just, like, points it and fires it.

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:45.600
There's not, like, a...

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:48.280
There's not any, like, video game-y animation.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.200
