00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:56.520
But, like, it feels like you can aim and fire, and it's, like, very swift and effective.

00:12:57.300 --> 00:13:03.820
Very masculine. It's the way that you also, like, you press A to draw the gun, and he just kind of, like, holds it out there.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:05.260
But then...

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.560
Right, which is badass. Then you press A again to fire, you know?

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:10.520
